<https://starwars.com#planet_Aargau>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Aargau was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Core Worlds, in grid square L-10 on the Standard Galactic Grid, that was headquarters of the Bank of Aargau. Colossal seventh-stage bank-courier repulsor-trucks were used on Aargau. " ;
