<https://starwars.com#planet_Aargonar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Aargonar was a planet located in the galaxy. During the Clone Wars, the husband of Confederacy of Independent Systems Senator Mina Bonteri went there to set up a base for the Separatists, but was killed when Republic clone troopers attacked. It was the homeworld of the human Imperial stormtrooper TK-14057. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#a5e3ad25-e47a-4b79-a10f-2325ae6be470> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_Q7> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Perkell> ;
