<https://starwars.com#planet_Abregado-rae>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Abregado-rae, also known simply as Abregado and sometimes spelled Abregado-Rae, was a trade world located in the galaxy's Core Worlds. It was situated at the beginning of the Rimma Trade Route. Abregado-rae had the reputation to be a rather lawless world, and its main spaceport was as close to a safe dock for smugglers as could be found in the Core. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#2feed657-b946-4fc4-9142-0d3a845c03a7> ;
