<https://starwars.com#planet_Adoris>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Adoris was a terrestrial astronomical object located in the Adoris system of the Senex sector, a part of the Senex-Juvex region in the Western Reaches portion of the Mid Rim. A hyperlane linked it to the Caltinia and Knores systems. It was home to the tooka, a species of felines also referred to as 'Adoris Felines' that were famous throughout the galaxy. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#5049cd41-3a1e-4ae4-a2f1-4d013dac0637> ;
