<https://starwars.com#planet_Aduba>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Aduba was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories way out on the edge of Wild Space, positioned at the coordinates U-11 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It was the homeworld of Cobalt Hammer pilot Finch Dallow. Dallow flew crop-dusters and spotter rigs on Aduba before qualifying for a post in the New Republic Scout Service. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#def87808-328c-4ed8-98d4-acf9843dd792> ;
