<https://starwars.com#planet_Algara>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Algara II, also referred to simply as Algara and Algar was a planet in the Algaran system of the Lambda sector, located in the Mid Rim with a population of approximately 1 billion. It was also the homeworld of the Xan. Algara II was orbited by four moons: Kevron, Omakaton, Radeon and Tallakron. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#131ebbd4-2247-424e-81d9-49f822e530b0> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Corweillian> , <https://starwars.com#grid_P15> ;
