<https://starwars.com#planet_Argus>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Argus was a Human-inhabited planet in the Argus system. When the New Order was instituted, Argus's Celestial School of Spaceflight Engineering was closed down. At least one of the school's professors, Maggis, became a teacher at the Imperial Naval Academy on Imperial Center, rather than be blacklisted from ever teaching again. " ;
