<https://starwars.com#planet_Aruza>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Aruza was a planet orbited by five moons of pale shades of tan, silver, and green. The planet was home to the peaceful Aruzans, an even-tempered society that abhorred violence. By 3 ABY, Aruza had not experienced a murder for over one hundred of their years. They were small people with light blue skin and very dark blue hair. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#e57b9425-dfff-4fa9-80cf-f1babba75c19> ;
