        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Atravis was an astronomical object located in the regions known as the Outer Rim Territories and the Western Reaches. It was also situated in the grid square L-19 of the Standard Galactic Grid. The super-hyperroute known as the Hydian Way connected Atravis to Rutan and Shumavar. Atravis also shared its name with the Atravis sector, which contained the nearby Mustafar system. " ;
