        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Baroli was the homeworld of the Barolian pilots Jano Brayson and Teff. Around 231 BBY, when the two reunited on the Starlight Beacon space station after becoming Z-29 Skyhawk pilots in the Galactic Republic's Firebird Squadron, Teff commented that they were a long way from Baroli, which Brayson agreed with. " ;
