        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Celwis was a planet of the Chiss Ascendancy and a stronghold of the Xodlak family. Though Celwis was economically valuable, the world was politically insignificant. While plotting to lead the Chiss into a civil war, Haplif of the Agbui resided on Celwis for a time in order to manipulate the Xodlak Councilor Xodlak'uvi'vil. " ;
