        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Columus was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Core Worlds which was the homeworld of the Columi. The pirate queen Maz Kanata hid a portion of the spoils from her reign there in a buried vault equipped with an antitamper sub-space alarm. As of when she marked Columus on a map in the Smuggler's Guide logbook at some point prior to or during 10 BBY, the alarm protecting the cache of treasure on Columus had not sounded. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#d6818ffc-0dc5-4d08-af10-41c138e09250> ;
