<https://starwars.com#planet_Cularin>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Cularin was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Expansion Region. During the Clone Wars, a battle was fought there, during which the lead Maelstrom-class battle cruiser, Maelstrom, served with distinction under the command of Jedi General Darrus Jeht. " ;
