<https://starwars.com#planet_Cybloc>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Cybloc was a greenish planet orbiting the star Erg Es 992 in the Meridian sector. During the Clone Wars there was a space station in orbit over the planet. Darth Maul and his brother Savage Opress broke into the space station and stole some credits. One of its moons, Cybloc XII, housed a New Republic trade base. However, the region was purged during the Death Seed incident. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#f1e0fa68-3afb-41c4-813d-f00e651711b4> ;
