<https://starwars.com#planet_Denebia>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Denebia was an agriworld in the Senex sector of the Mid Rim. It was located on the Senex-Juvex Loop, at the junction of a hyperlane that led to the planet Suliana in The Tangles. It was a cool world, covered by dry plains which were punctuated by plantations and towns belonging to House Hax. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#c9bfbda5-8ce2-4338-a1c2-1977e08b34bf> ;
