        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Drearia was an astronomical object located in the regions known as the Inner Rim and the Interior. It was also situated in grid square L-8 of the Standard Galactic Grid, and the super-hyperroute known as the Hydian Way linked Drearia to the Paqualis system as well as the world Champala. Drearia shared its name with the company Drearian Defense Conglomerate. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#719df60d-0010-4535-afd0-6e407f7d46ef> ;
