        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Durgen's Star was a white dwarf star that was located in the Durgen's Star system. It was situated in the Loop Worlds area of the Gordian Reach sector, within the Trans-Hydian portion of the Outer Rim Territories. Durgen's Star lay on the hyperlane known as the Junction-Tierell Loop, which connected it to the Povanaria and Trinovat systems. " ;
