<https://starwars.com#planet_Gromas>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Gromas was an astronomical object located in the Perkell sector of the galaxy's Mid Rim. It was the location of an Imperial depot and supported a mining operation for phrik, a metallic compound that was nearly indestructible. In the year 14 BBY, the Imperial Joint Chiefs believed Gromas' depot was a possible target for former Republic Intelligence captain Berch Teller and his rebel cell and dispatched a task force to defend the installation. The rebels learned of this, however, and attacked Phindar instead. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#3534176a-1f82-4bc4-978d-a0d8f5a3bd79> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_Q7> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Perkell> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Gromas" .
