<https://starwars.com#planet_Harrin>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Harrin was an astronomical object located in the regions known as the Inner Rim and the Trailing Sectors. It was situated in the grid square L-15 of the Standard Galactic Grid. The super-hyperroute known as the Corellian Trade Spine connected Harrin to the world Yag'Dhul as well as the Expansion Region's Kinyen, while another hyperspace route linked it to Wroona. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#ff44ecf2-0640-4678-91c1-79fed8bf80e0> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Harrin> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L15> ;
