<https://starwars.com#planet_Iskalon>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Iskalon was a planet located in the galaxy's Mid Rim. The pirate Queen Maz Kanata hid a portion of the spoils from her reign there in a buried vault equipped with a antitamper sub-space alarm. As of when she began writing the book that would become known as the Smuggler's Guide, the alarm protecting the cache of treasure on Iskalon had not sounded. " ;
