<https://starwars.com#planet_Issagra>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Issagra was a planet in the Issagra system. It was located approximately twelve hours hyperspace travel from Fether. Its most notable location was a large space station. Over three kilometers long, the station was devoted to trade and gambling, and could house tens of thousands of visitors and hundreds of freighters at a time. The station's atmosphere was often regarded as grand and exotic, though organized crime held sway in the background and contraband could be found in numerous locations. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#70fe863c-727f-4676-a98f-6eb4f06a56fc> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_S4> , <https://starwars.com#sector_CorporateSector> ;
