<https://starwars.com#planet_Jubilar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Jubilar was a location that was used as a prison by the Confederacy of Independent Systems. During the Clone Wars, it was one of several locations where a majority of Separatist prisoners were sent. Jubilar remained a prison after the rise of the New Republic, which incarcerated Borbin Todds there to serve a twenty-five-year sentence for harbouring a wanted fugitive. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#0740a884-9c8d-4da7-88bf-5fefca77f3d2> ;
