        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Kalist VI, also known as Kalist, was a world located in the galaxy's Deep Core where the Galactic Empire had a penal colony. It was the homeworld of the Rebel pilot Dak Ralter, who was born to a family of political prisoners in the colony. Ralter escaped the world with bright ambitions, but was killed in the Battle of Hoth. " ;
