<https://starwars.com#planet_Karlinus>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Karlinus was a prosperous planet located in the Chommell sector of the galaxy's Mid Rim, known for its agricultural industry and its workforce with a high turnover rate. When Padmé Amidala wished to rescue slaves from Tatooine, she and Sabé chose to let them live a new life on Karlinus. Sabé managed to rescue twenty-five slaves, giving them jobs on Karlinus with the help of the planet's governor, Kelma. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#5709af7e-58b1-4f7c-8d89-aa16abf59b29> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Chommel> , <https://starwars.com#grid_O16> ;
