        rdf:type                 ies:PlaceName ;
        ies:representationValue  "Kerkoidia" .

<https://starwars.com#planet_Kerkoidia>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Kerkoidia was a blue-gray planet located in the Expansion Region, in the grid square N-15 of the Standard Galactic Grid. The Kerkoiden male Whorm Loathsom was a native of Kerkoidia and for a long time served in its planetary defense forces. Loathsom eventually earned the rank of general with the Confederacy of Independent Systems. In addition to Loathsom joining the Confederacy of Independent Systems, the Retail Caucus was headquarted on Kerkoida and was a large donor of the CIS. After the Battle of Endor, the New Republic managed to liberate Kerkoidia from the Galactic Empire. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#14c173a9-b54d-4dc8-96bd-59772806c37e> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_N15> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Kira> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Kerkoidia" .
@prefix ies:      <http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#> .
@prefix rdf:      <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:     <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix graphql: <http://ndtp.co.uk/ontology/> .

<https://starwars.com#planet_Kesh>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Under the leadership of Grand Lord Hilts, the Tribe annexed Alanciar in 2975 BBY, which was home to another Keshiri civilization, who called themselves the Alanciari. Using Alanciar's abundant resources and industrial base, the Sith were able to build a fleet of wooden sailing vessels which enabled them to explore and conquer the other landmasses and seas of Kesh particularly in the unexplored northern hemisphere. By 2974 BBY, the Sith discovered the southern polar continent of Eshkrene and the Doomed. That same year, the ancient Sith Lord Remulus Dreypa was also killed in an brief outbreak of violence. In 41 ABY, the Lost Tribe rediscovered interstellar travel when an ancient Sith Meditation Sphere known as Ship landed on the planet and allied itself with the Tribe. The Tribe then assembled a Sith armada and sought to expand into the galaxy. This put them into contact and conflict with both the New Jedi Order and a powerful entity known as Abeloth. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#64f841a1-aaa9-491b-8c83-a61ee0b054f3> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_U10> , <https://starwars.com#region_WildSpace> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Kesh" .

<https://starwars.com#64f841a1-aaa9-491b-8c83-a61ee0b054f3>
        rdf:type                 ies:PlaceName ;
        ies:representationValue  "Kesh" .
