<https://starwars.com#planet_Kessel>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "A mining planet that has been fought over by crime lords for its valuable Spice. A fissure vent beneath the spice mines served as a source of astatic coaxium, an element that could be refined into hyperfuel for starships." ;
