        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Kitel Phard was an astronomical object located in the regions known as the Core Worlds and the Interior, in the grid square J-12 of the Standard Galactic Grid. A hyperspace route connected it to the planet Giju. Kitel Phard shared its name with the Kitel Phard dynasty. During the reign of the Galactic Empire, the latter was associated with a style of expensive vases. " ;
