        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Lucazec was an astronomical object located in the Outer Rim Territories along the Salin Corridor that was controlled by the Galactic Empire. A group of rebels once stole an Imperial corvette known as the Carrion Spike and launched an attack on the Empire's mining operations on Lucazec, controlled through TaggeCo. They broadcasted a holovid of their activities. " ;
