<https://starwars.com#planet_Lyran>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Lyran was a world in the galaxy where Chass na Chadic, pilot in the New Republic's Alphabet Squadron, had once visited. Several weeks after the Battle of Endor in 4 ABY, Chadic and her squadron visited a Jedi temple on the moon of the planet Harkrova I, where they found a holographic map of the galaxy. Chadick recognized Lyran in the map. " ;
