<https://starwars.com#planet_Manforgon>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Manforgon was a planet located in the Mid Rim's Senex sector. It was used for centuries as a penal colony of the Senex-Juvex region. Eventually becoming a lawless world fought over by warlords, Manforgon was turned over to the Galactic Empire by the noble houses of the Senex-Juvex. The Empire used the planet for military purposes, and during the Galactic Civil War, Imperial Customs Officer Tellix served there. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#bbbae0ac-8880-424c-9b3c-92389ac5bca5> ;
