<https://starwars.com#planet_Minashee>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Minashee was the homeworld of Jedi Master Sifo-Dyas and of his father, who worked as a fisherman. It was part of the Cassandran Worlds. While recording a holocomm for his sister, Jenza, Jedi Initiate Dooku mentioned that Sifo-Dyas was from Minashee. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#9b906b88-2454-4ae6-af71-ed9c0d476c6b> ;
