<https://starwars.com#planet_Moltok>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Moltok was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories that was home to a Ho'Din settlement. During the reign of the Galactic Empire, the settlement came under attack from a local Makurth boss leading the Ho'Din to request the aid of Imperial muscle to prevent the crisis from becoming a full-fledged war. Imperial forces stationed aboard the Gozanti-class cruiser Blood Crow under the command of Captain Filia Rossi were sent to settle the matter. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#4ecbe8ab-9043-43ad-ac8a-dd3f1c6c75a5> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_L5> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Atrivis> ;
