        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "During the reign of the Galactic Empire, crime lord Dryden Vos of the Crimson Dawn syndicate had the rally master lance stolen for his private collection. For a while, Ordo suspected the people of Krownest―a fellow Mandalorian-inhabited world―of the artifact's theft, though the Scabbard Monument of Krownest had also found itself burglarized by Dryden Vos around the same time. " ;
