        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Povanaria was a planet in the Gordian Reach. It was located on the Junction-Tierell Loop, between Durgen's Star and Bronsoon. Povanaria was windswept, and most of the world was covered by low grasses and mosses. It was also home to a sentient species, the Povanarians. " ;
