        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Presteen was a trade world located in the Presteen system of the Senex sector, a part of the Senex-Juvex region in the Western Reaches portion of the Mid Rim. The Senex-Juvex Loop hyperlane linked it to the Caltinia and Veron systems. Presteen was under the control of the lesser nobles of House Araba, based on the nearby planet of Cyimarra. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#b0eda8d6-c2e2-47d6-ae36-750e103d6148> ;
