<https://starwars.com#planet_Qmara>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Q'mara, located in the Q'mara system of the Juvex sector, was a desert planet with a number of shabby spaceports, where all manner of smugglers and thugs sought illicit employment. Juvex nobles frequented Q'mara's houses of ill repute; foolish ones were drawn into its subterranean gambling and spice dens, sometimes never to return. Qellrin was attacked by pirates near Q'mara. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#8304b482-9528-4ac6-bbf8-680e9fac7bde> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_L18> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Juvex> ;
