<https://starwars.com#planet_QuaensanPrime>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Quaensan Prime was a Gendius sector, Mid Rim world on the Cerean Reach, near the Jiroch system. Its inhabitants were wiped out by the Reslian Purge, similar to what happened to the Tunroth. " ;
