<https://starwars.com#planet_QuasKillam>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Quas Killam was a planet on the edge of the Mid Rim. Its people were the Killam. Quas Killam was a world of weapons manufacturing factories and trinium mines, and so was conquered by the Trade Federation early in the Clone Wars. Throughout the war the planet changed sides several times. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#46204d50-090e-443a-81e8-1a3d7d28fdb9> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Couronne> , <https://starwars.com#grid_P10> ;
