<https://starwars.com#planet_Quesh>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Queshː (pronounciation: /'kwɛʃ/) was a world riddled with toxic waste within Hutt Space, due to a period of geological instability in the past dubbed the Quake. It was discovered by the Galactic Republic during the Great War, but was promptly abandoned due to its poisonous atmosphere. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#25411bec-7ae8-407a-aa25-3baff232de7a> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_S10> , <https://starwars.com#sector_HuttSpace> ;
