        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The Sedratis system was located in the Slice portion of the Core Worlds, specifically in the region known as the Arrowhead. It was situated on the super-hyperroute known as the Corellian Run, between the Rehemsa and Namaryne systems.[1] The Sedratis system contained[3] Sedratis City, which in turn was the site of the Sedratis Coliseum." ;
