<https://starwars.com#planet_Sinton>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The planet Sinton was located in the Sinton system, a part of the Mid Rim's Rago sector. It lay along the Rago Run hyperlane, which connected it to the Moro and Gilatter systems. Sinton was populated by non-Humans, and at some point by 3 ABY, the planet was subjugated by the Galactic Empire, which subjected the planet's inhabitants to slave labor. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#a657e7d0-558b-4f8b-ae89-c30e525564ac> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Rago> , <https://starwars.com#grid_I7> ;
