<https://starwars.com#planet_Station88>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The Station 88 Spaceport, or simply Station 88, was a large spaceport founded by the rulers of Delaluna, Junction V, Bezim and the Vicondor systems. Located along the Celanon Spur in the Mid Rim's Vorc sector, it was a key strategic area for the Confederacy of Independent Systems, for it was the gateway to the Mid Rim star systems. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#94b5cdd9-af5e-4933-907a-1ab3051370f5> ;
