<https://starwars.com#planet_TertiaryKesmere>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Tertiary Kesmere was a cloudy, storm-wracked world located in the Tertiary Kesmere system, a part of the Raioballo sector in the New Territories portion of the Outer Rim Territories. It was the homeworld of the winged hornagaunt species, including the wing-clipped pet Grendel. Between 4 ABY and 12 ABY, Tertiary Kesmere fell within the borders of the Pentastar Alignment. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#3c1c98ec-9ffe-409a-b326-1b0373fe43ba> ;
