<https://starwars.com#planet_Thakwaa>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Thakwaa was a terrestrial astronomical object located in the Outer Rim Territories and positioned at the coordinates I-19 on the Standard Galactic Grid. The Red Isles was a location on Thakwaa, where the Rebel Alliance pilot Nath Tensent and his astromech droid T5 had to spend a night some time prior to the Battle of Endor, fought in 4 ABY. For protection against flies, T5 convinced Tensent to create an ointment from plant stems, which had a side effect of causing rashes. According to Tensent, nothing interesting occurred during his time on Thakwaa, and the two departed several days later. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#f71fce9b-a844-4a78-8499-9660dae034a0> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_I19> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Tunka> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Thakwaa" .
