<https://starwars.com#planet_Thape>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Thape was an astronomical object located in the Thape system, a part of the Lambda sector in The Slice portion of the Mid Rim. It lay on a hyperlane between Ando and Leritor. It was a place of origin of the Order of Dai Bendu, a mystic Force tradition that preceded the birth of the Jedi Order. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#28c04ea0-a2f9-45a5-9d70-f03ad26f007d> ;
