<https://starwars.com#planet_TheCometwash>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The Cometwash was the name for a blue giant star in the Gordian Reach along the Feena Run that was surrounded by swarms of comets. The system became a stopping point for many spacers rechecking their jump calculations after navigating around the Roil and tourists wanting to catch a glimpse. " ;
