<https://starwars.com#planet_Thisspias>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Thisspias was a rocky, temperate planet located in the galaxy's Expansion Region. It was the homeworld of the Thisspiasian species, including the Jedi Master Oppo Rancisis. The planet had been a member of the Galactic Republic for a very long time, and was also the site of many important battles, particularly during the Great Manifest Period. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#34dc2286-a528-46f2-afd2-68ee26349dca> ;
