        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Turkana was a planet in the Outer Rim Territories that served as an Alliance to Restore the Republic regional headquarters and operations sector during the Galactic Civil War. Turkana was included in a map of the galaxy that listed safe worlds, starfighter hubs at level five or higher, regional headquarters and operations sectors, and deep space caches. " ;
