        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "UR-1060 was an astronomical object located in the Moddell sector of the Outer Rim Territories in grid square H-16 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It shared a similar designation to the nearby UR-2650, UR-3741, UR-8827, and UR-9353. UR-1060 was depicted on a map of the Moddell sector included with the Rebel Alliance collection of non-electronic documents known as The Rebel Files. " ;
