<https://starwars.com#planet_Vallt>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Galen Erso and his team were working on Vallt for Zerpen Industries when the Vallt government was overthrown in a coup by those sympathetic to the Separatist movement. This led to Erso quickly being thrown into Tambolor prison on charges of espionage. The planet thus shifted from being a Republic–aligned planet to a Separatist one during this period. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#2397905b-984f-47f9-97fe-d998ef347287> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#region_OuterRim> ;
