<https://starwars.com#planet_Vergill>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Vergill was a planet located within the Vergill system of the Inner Rim. It was an influential member of the Hapes Consortium. In 25 ABY, the planet's archon was Beed Thane. " ;
