<https://starwars.com#person_CassianAndor>
        rdf:type              ies:Person ;
        rdfs:comment          "Cassian Jeron Andor, also known by the aliases Willix, Aach, Joreth Sward, and the codename Fulcrum, was a human male soldier, pilot, and intelligence officer who served in the Confederacy of Independent Systems during the Clone Wars, and, later, with the Alliance to Restore the Republic during the Galactic Civil War. Andor was a skilled operative, working as a spy and an assassin, performing many missions for the Alliance." ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#e3fb06b2-930d-491f-b34e-2c73751faff9> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Cassian Andor" .

