<https://starwars.com#person_BrehaOrgana>
        rdf:type              ies:Person ;
        rdfs:comment          "Breha Organa was a human female who served as Queen of the planet Alderaan during the Clone Wars and the early days of the Galactic Civil War. At the end of the Clone Wars, she and her husband, Senator Bail Prestor Organa, adopted the newborn Leia. The girl, the biological daughter of the late Senator Padmé Amidala of Naboo and fallen Jedi Knight Anakin Skywalker, became Princess Leia Organa of Alderaan." ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#9c1204b2-d5ec-4a82-a9af-7fc010d926b1> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Breha Organa" .

