<https://starwars.com#planet_Abraxas>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Abraxas was a planet in the Abraxas system situated within the Yushan sector of the Mid Rim Territories. Abraxas was run dry of its rich natural resources by overwhelming mining, and became a base for the Eiattu pirates. Soon after the Battle of Endor, the New Republic discovered and threw the pirates out. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#5e1dd144-4653-451a-b240-17651eb3c54c> ;
