<https://starwars.com#planet_Adarlon>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Adarlon was a location whose population supposedly suffered a famine while under the control of the New Republic, according to claims made in the news feeds of the First Order. The stormtrooper FN-2187 viewed such a news report during a morale session within his training on Starkiller Base, shortly before his deployment to the planet Jakku in 34 ABY. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#dd7f7346-564e-44b3-aca0-b5d252b84267> ;
