<https://starwars.com#planet_Akuria>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Akuria was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories, not far from the planet Dantooine, that was a suspected base of rebel operations. Akuria and several other locations were identified in a 3 ABY Imperial Security Bureau report that generated targets for Viper probe droid surveys by cross-referencing areas with a high degree of suspicious activity with the unsettled parts of the galaxy favored by the rebels. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#9cd5e591-b876-457f-a489-0508daedebaf> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_M5> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Oplovis> ;
