<https://starwars.com#planet_AratFraca>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Arat Fraca was a planet located in the Arat Fraca system of the Colonies. The Star Morning suddenly reappeared over Arat Fraca a year after leaving Motexx for Gowdawl. Arat Fraca was two sectors away from Motexx. From Arat Fraca, the Star Morning proceeded to Darepp, where it landed. " ;
