<https://starwars.com#planet_Arkanis>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Following the Galactic Empire's losses at the Battle of Endor, Arkanis remained under the Empire's control for a time, but the system was targeted by the New Republic, freed from the Empire's influence and claimed for the New Republic's side. Arkanis eventually became a wealthy planet of the New Republic, aligned with the Centrists, and represented in the Galactic Senate by Senator Carise Sindian. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#2370f4fb-a2fc-4728-ae13-533430913f17> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_R17> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Arkanis> ;
