<https://starwars.com#planet_Arkuda>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Arkuda was a small rocky planet in the Gordian Reach inhabited by the Arkudans. The planet was renowned for its nighttime view of the stars, due to its proximity to the Roil, a large stellar nursery in the Reach. Arkuda was also one endpoint to the Korphir Trace which pushed through the Roil. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#7086cccc-d097-4ed7-bd42-927d9cdd2ec0> ;
