<https://starwars.com#planet_Baradas>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Baradas was a terrestrial astronomical object. During the Galactic Civil War between the Rebel Alliance and the Galactic Empire, the rebel pilot and squadron commander Nath Tensent experienced a bad landing on Baradas in his first Y-wing starfighter sometime after his defection to the Alliance from the Empire around 0 BBY. The incident resulted in the starfighter's underside and one of its nacelles being torn off, the remains of the Y-wing being irreparable. " ;
