<https://starwars.com#planet_Barlok>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Barlok was a planet in the Barlok system of the Marcol sector, between three and six days of hyperspace travel from Coruscant, and was also a member world of the Galactic Republic. It was known for tisvollt forests, inhabited by the indigenous Karfs; its agricultural produce, including delicious prisht fruit; its sprawling Patameene District, including the Starbright hotel, Panky's restaurant, and the Covered Brush housing ring; and its mines, the ownership of which was a point of dispute between the guilds of the indigenous Brolfi and the Corporate Alliance, including the Mining Guild. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#c8582200-d511-49b6-85dc-c629436aca1c> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Marcol> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L8> ;
