        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Bavva was a planet inside the Anoat sector in the the galaxy. Over several months during the Iron Blockade of the sector by the Galactic Empire, a merchant on Bavva was robbed several times. The merchant then offered payment for an experienced individual to provide them personal security. " ;
