<https://starwars.com#planet_Bnar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Bnar VII was an astronomical object[2] located in the Bnar system, a part of the Braxant sector in the New Territories portion of the Outer Rim Territories.[1] The decades-long career of the Noehon slaver Tir'uh saw her operate within an area of the galaxy spanning from Bnar VII,[2] in the northern section of the galaxy,[1] to Kessel,[2] a planet in the galaxy's eastern portion.[3] In 2 ABY,[4] a Rebel Alliance Task Force on Alliance Security SecuriDex datafile on the Mytaranor Slaving Council, of which Tir'uh was a member, noted the possibility that the Noehon was familiar with every location between Bnar VII and Kessel that was related to the slaving business.[2]" ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#4cf925b4-de05-4cbf-b8d9-3bc30d35e5ab> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Braxant> , <https://starwars.com#grid_K3> ;
