<https://starwars.com#planet_Chalcedon>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Chalcedon was astronomical object located in the galaxy's the Tashtor sector within the Mid Rim. Located on a hyperspace route between Cerea and Takodana, it was the center of the galactic slave trade. Chalcedon also housed a shadowport and was marked on a map included by the former pirate Queen Maz Kanata in the book that became known as the Smuggler's Guide. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#17582108-8c97-443e-b1d5-e7bcbcf9c758> ;
