        rdfs:comment          "Cilpar was an agriworld in the Colonies, nearly covered in mountains, jungles, and forests. It was characterized by the near-indestructible ancient temples scattered across the surface. Local flora and fauna included the predatory ronk. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#cf2ae40b-4f05-4a62-a6ab-d8870e9644b0> ;
