<https://starwars.com#planet_CollaIV>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Colla IV was a planet located in the galaxy's Inner Rim, in grid square N-9 on the Standard Galactic Grid where droidekas were manufactured by the Colicoids, while the droid tri-fighter's three-armed design mimicked the skull features of one of its ferocious predators. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#f0561847-3fec-4429-86ab-5d525d1638f1> ;
