        rdfs:comment          "Dankayo was a location in the galaxy's Colonies that was a suspected base of rebel operations. Dankayo and several other locations were identified in a 3 ABY Imperial Security Bureau report that generated targets for Viper probe droid surveys by cross-referencing areas with a high degree of suspicious activity with the unsettled parts of the galaxy favored by the rebels. " ;
