<https://starwars.com#planet_Dulin>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The Dulin system was located in the Inner Rim.[1] It contained Dulin starport.[2][3] One year, the northern approach vector to Dulin starport was temporarily closed for two hours due to the local city's celebration of the New Year Fete Week. As a result, starships arriving at the starport were instructed to use the southern approach vector instead." ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#dc201097-d800-4b39-9e01-2af67e05d458> ;
