<https://starwars.com#planet_Foerost>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Foerost was a terrestrial astronomical object and the site of the Battle of Foerost, which took place by 14 BBY. The Drabatan Pao carried out a demolitions job on Foerost, his first known mission with the Rebel Alliance, which involved taking out a communications tower sometime by 0 BBY. The rebel Captain Cassian Andor remembered the Drabatan's job shortly before the Battle of Scarif that year, where the captain's team carried out a similar job. Andor thought to himself that he would ask Pao about the job before the mission began. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#683c862c-c421-4f86-8f6c-dfc2c5ff5fe2> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#region_Core> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L10> ;
