<https://starwars.com#planet_Galand>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Galand was a Core world. It was homeworld of the near-Human Galandans, including the religious martyr H'kig. His teachings formed the basis of the H'kig philosophy. To escape persecution, the H'kig fled to distant Rishi. " ;
