        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Gannaria was a terrestrial planet located in the Trilon sector, a part of the Outer Rim Territories. Situated in grid square H-15 of the Standard Galactic Grid, it was linked by hyperspace routes to the Batuu and Zaddja systems and shared its name with the route known as the Gannarian Run. " ;
