<https://starwars.com#planet_Gargon>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Gargon was a mountainous planet. It was settled by the Old Mandalorians, who were exiled from their homeworld of Mandalore by the pacifistic New Mandalorians after a civil war in approximately 42 BBY. On Gargon, they lived as mercenaries working for the highest bidder, as Mandalorians had done for millennia. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#42785417-6bf0-4bf2-95e8-3735623d93f4> ;
