<https://starwars.com#planet_Goroth>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Goroth, also known as Goroth Prime, was a location in the galaxy. When Agent Alecia Beck of the Imperial Security Bureau requested a meeting with Senator Mon Mothma, Mothma's aide, Hendri Underholt, lied to Beck and told her that Mothma had already left Coruscant and had gone on a fact-finding mission to Goroth. " ;
