        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Gulvitch was a mining planet located in the Gordian Reach. It sat on the Junction-Tierell Loop, between Bronsoon and Arkuda. The planet was home to a struggling colony founded by the Povanarians and Bagmims. Gulvitch was rarely visited by those who could afford to go elsewhere. " ;
