<https://starwars.com#planet_Heffrin>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Heffrin was a planet located in the Arkanis sector of the Outer Rim. This mountainous world was a small mining colony maintained by the Galactic Empire. The planet held important ruins from a vanished civilization, including the Heffrin Aqueducts, which spanned Heffrin's continents; research during the Cold War between the Galactic Republic and the Sith Empire identified the Aqueducts' builders as early Ithorian explorers. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#092548f8-0b7a-4098-9e14-df672604366f> ;
