<https://starwars.com#planet_Hutlar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Hutlar was a small, chilly world located in the Mid Rim's Senex sector. Orbiting a red dwarf star, it was the homeworld of the sentient Hutlarians. They served the aristocratic Ancient Houses of the Senex-Juvex region in various roles until 553 BBY, when their home was liberated from the nobles' control. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#d1c61e2c-e15a-475f-be2e-8ccd47b3bb1d> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Senex> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L18> ;
