<https://starwars.com#planet_Klatooine>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Klatooine was a desert planet located within Hutt Space of the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories that was the homeworld of the Klatooinian species. The former pirate Queen Maz Kanata marked it as a point of interest on a map she included in the book that would become known as the Smuggler's Guide. The xenolinguist Jaiyna Sibinth, who studied the language of Pasaana's Aki-Aki, saw similar recurring symbols and themes to the native cultures of other desert planets, including Klatooine's. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#2a51bf56-fbf3-4463-b227-b1fe3dbdcedc> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_HuttSpace> , <https://starwars.com#grid_S9> ;
