<https://starwars.com#planet_Krant>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Krant was a wilderness planet in the Bothan sector. It saw action from the Clone Wars and the Galactic Civil War, and the Jedi Master Echuu Shen-Jon hid on Krant during decades until Princess Leia Organa appeared on the planet, searching for the Bothan agent Utric Sandov. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#850ba946-7a23-4154-9fad-2144c3e76c5a> ;
