        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Kuna's Eye was a celestial body situated in the Outer Rim Territories' Moddell sector in grid square H-16 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It was connected to the astronomical objects Kuna's Fist and Kuna's Tooth via hyperspace routes. Kuna's Eye was depicted on a map of the Moddell sector included with the collection of non-electronic Rebel Alliance documents known as The Rebel Files. " ;
