        rdfs:comment          "Kuna's Tooth was an astronomical object located in the Moddell sector of the Outer Rim Territories in grid square H-16 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It was connected by hyperspace routes to the celestial bodies Annaj, Kuna's Eye, and Qina. Kuna's Tooth was depicted on a map of the Moddell sector included with the Rebel Alliance collection of non-electronic documents known as The Rebel Files. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#4db142b6-a06e-4f3c-b6bc-09277906e926> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_H16> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Moddell> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Kuna's Tooth" .
