<https://starwars.com#planet_Mirial>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Mirial was a cold and dry desert planet located in the Mirial system of the Outer Rim Territories. It was the homeworld of the near-human Mirialan species, including Jedi Master Luminara Unduli and her Padawan Barriss Offee. Unduli honored the traditions of the world by selecting a fellow Mirialan as her apprentice. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#fc0a7e04-f5c7-4857-8f66-def9ff771757> ;
