        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Molavar was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories, on the junction of the Triellus Trade Route and the Manda Merchant Run, just a short jump south of Scarif. The hyperlanes that linked Molavar to the planet Tatooine were controlled by the crime lord Jabba Desilijic Tiure. " ;
