<https://starwars.com#planet_Naporar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Naporar was a planet in the Chiss Ascendancy and was also the headquarters of the Chiss Expansionary Defense Fleet. Naporar contained a medcenter where Mitth'raw'nuruodo underwent physical therapy after the Vagaari pirate operations. Mitth'ali'astov received her sky-walker training at the Expansionary Fleet complex there. After Csaplar was targeted by three alien warships, four Expansionary Fleet]] warships were sent from Naporar to support defenses on Csilla. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#67d92434-3a96-478e-8228-5ee07b2d1bc4> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_F8> , <https://starwars.com#sector_ChissAscendancy> ;
