        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Nazzri was an astronomical object located in the regions known as the Mid Rim and the Slice. It was also situated in the grid square P-9 of the Standard Galactic Grid. A hyperspace route linked it to the celestial body Togoria as well as the Expansion Region astronomical object Vena. " ;
