        rdfs:comment          "Nimia was a planet located in the Hutt Space between Klatooine and Yoribuunt. It was located near the Si'Klaata Cluster. A lackluster industrial world, Nimia was occasionally used as a meeting place between Hutt servants and outlanders who had failed to attract much favor with the Hutts. " ;
