        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Obroa-skai was a planet located in the Obroa-skai system of the galaxy's Inner Rim. It was known mostly for its libraries and medcenters. At the end of the Clone Wars, one of those medcenters bought a fleet of Sephi flyers from Thustra for use during emergency evacuations. Galen Walton Erso served as a teacher at a college on the planet. " ;
