        rdfs:comment          "Ord Biniir was an astronomical object located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories, in grid square K-5 on the Standard Galactic Grid. Prior to the Galactic Civil War, the Alliance to Restore the Republic launched a successful assault on Imperial targets there. However the resulting victory did not show the full potency of the rebellion. " ;
