        rdfs:comment          "Ord Cestus, also referred to as simply Cestus, was a planet in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories. Located in the vicinity of the Perlemian Trade Route, it was situated a considerable distance away from common routes between Geonosis and Coruscant. During the Clone Wars, the Galactic Republic established a medical station near Ord Cestus. " ;
