        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Ord Pardron was a planet located in the galaxy's Mid Rim that was a safe world for the Alliance to Restore the Republic. A map of the galaxy with a legend listing the various Alliance safe worlds, starfighter hubs at level five or higher, rebel operations sectors and regional headquarters, and shadow planets with deep space caches, included Ord Pardron. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#b0ee7d6f-35d9-483e-a0ff-de6bb8aebdc9> ;
