<https://starwars.com#planet_Ossiathora>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Ossiathora was an agriworld located in the Ossiathora system of the Juvex sector, a part of the Senex-Juvex region in the Western Reaches portion of the Mid Rim. The Senex-Juvex Loop hyperlane linked it to the Deminol and Kassido systems. Ossiathora was the origin point of Ossiathoran noodles and was controlled by House Kassido, a noble house based on the world of Kassido. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#af43912d-3cd2-4801-acbe-bb0243abb615> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Juvex> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L17> ;
