<https://starwars.com#planet_Pantora>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Pantora was the primary moon in orbit around the planet Orto Plutonia, in the Pantora system, located in the Sujimis sector of the Outer Rim Territories, in grid square P-19 on the Standard Galactic Grid. It was the homeworld of the Pantorans, who were led by the Pantoran Assembly and the Supreme Chairman of Pantora, a post held by Chi Cho, who was later replaced by Baron Notluwiski Papanoida. Pantora was a member of the Galactic Republic and therefore represented in the Galactic Senate. During the Clone Wars, Pantora remained loyal to the Republic and Riyo Chuchi served as its senator. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#62760f68-12fc-4e5d-afc9-f800d8a86286> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_P19> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Sujimis> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Pantora" .

