<https://starwars.com#planet_PaqualisIII>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Paqualis III, also known as Paqualis, was a terrestrial astronomical object in the Inner Rim, situated along the Hydian Way and positioned at the coordinates L-8 on the Standard Galactic Grid. Following a skirmish with the bounty hunters 4-LOM and Zuckuss, the smuggler Han Solo offered to pilot the pair to an outpost on Paqualis III, near the Bounty Hunters' Guild. " ;
