<https://starwars.com#planet_Phateem>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Phateem was an uninhabited planet located in the Nouane sector, near Telerath, covered in bamboo forests and mountains. The Ashlendu Mountains on Phateem contained the Halls of Knowledge, a former Jedi artifact cache. A tournament was held at the Halls of Knowledge, though it was a front for an operation led by Imperial Security Bureau Colonel Sadao Emtri to catch Force-sensitive individuals. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#7b70382b-6f8d-487d-9ad2-93e9d44d6b06> ;
