<https://starwars.com#planet_Prazhi>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Prazhi was an Expansion Region planet located in the Cyrillian Protectorate. It was the homeworld of the Zexx species. A member of the galactic community since at least 5000 BBY, a millennium later Prazhi was situated on an important hyperspace trade route. By the time of the Galactic Empire's reign, Prazhi had become a trade world the economy of which was revitalized by Imperial efforts to resettle the Expansion Region. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#26bd28e5-1a29-4efd-8309-cc7babd087df> ;
