<https://starwars.com#planet_Qina>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Qina was an astronomical object located in the Moddell sector of the Outer Rim Territories in grid square H-16 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It was linked by hyperspace routes to the celestial bodies Kuna's Tooth, Thonner, and Trindello. Qina was depicted on a map of the Moddell sector included with the Rebel Alliance collection of non-electronic documents known as The Rebel Files. " ;
