        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Ques was a swampy planet near the inner border of Hutt Space, and its population primarily consisted of scavengers, such as Dec Hansen. The axton-tarsier, the ferin, the slime crab, and the Snarlap were creatures native to Ques. A school named teacher's cabin was located on Ques. " ;
