<https://starwars.com#planet_Rakhuuun>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Rakhuuun was a planet that was located in the Rakhuuun system of the Mytaranor sector. It was a part of the Kashyyyk Region, in the Slice portion of the Mid Rim. The Randon Run hyperlane connected the planet to the worlds of Chamble and Kashyyyk. " ;
