<https://starwars.com#planet_SheduMaad>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Shedu Maad was a planet in the Hapes Cluster, located within its Transitory Mists region. It was used as a hidden base for the Jedi Coalition after they evacuated their temporary base at Endor. It was here that the Coalition defeated Darth Caedus and ended the Second Galactic Civil War. A Jedi academy was established on the planet after the war and was still in use as of 44 ABY. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#96399559-60ce-4b51-a310-9458e77c510f> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_HapesCluster> , <https://starwars.com#grid_O9> ;
