        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Skorrupon was a terrestrial astronomical object where the New Republic pilots Wyl Lark and Kamala encountered a Twi'lek. Several weeks after the Battle of Endor in 4 ABY, Kamala, in a game of 'Who? What? Where?' chose the Twi'lek on Skorrupon to be the first to hear in the event of her death. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#1ccaa396-28a3-4982-a546-536b4637d086> ;
