<https://starwars.com#planet_Sleheyron>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Sleheyron was a planet located in the galaxy's Hutt Space region, in grid square S-10 on the Standard Galactic Grid, that was connected to Kessel, Klatooine, Nimban, and Varl by a hyperspace route. Controlled by the Hutt Clan, it was the homeworld of Hutt crime lord Ziro, who was covered in colorful tattoos indicating his connection to Sleheyron. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#8dd5aa52-796a-4acc-8e0f-85d321bd00da> ;
