<https://starwars.com#planet_Tammuz-an>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Tammuz-an was a planet located in the galaxy's Outer Rim Territories. Shortly after the end of the Clone Wars, the kingdom of Tammuz-an purchased a batch of R-22 prototypes from Kuat Systems Engineering designers for their planetary defense fleet, after the Galactic Empire rejected the ship for mass production. Tammuz-an was responsible for nicknaming the R-22 as 'Spearheads' after their resemblance to local spears. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#76c1f6cb-83c5-419d-9f8d-797337989046> ;
