        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Telaris was a location in the Telaris system. During the early rebellion against the Galactic Empire, the Alliance to Restore the Republic utilized the UT-60D U-wing starfighter/support craft as a cargo and VIP escort between Mon Cala and Telaris. The information was on a report that was later incorporated into The Rebel Files. " ;
