<https://starwars.com#planet_Telerath>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Telerath was a planet located in the Nouane sector of the Inner Rim. It was allegedly a resort world but had problems with gang violence. Disputes on Telerath were settled through sword combat, in a convention known as Sword Law. In a cantina on Telerath, the bounty hunter Jango Fett and his son, Boba, met with fellow hunters Neelda, Rinn, and Tiver, who Fett had hired for an upcoming mission. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#1ce86b73-5757-4c50-9f44-59e9fcb6c8ea> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Nouane> , <https://starwars.com#grid_N7> ;
