        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Tepasi was a planet located in the galaxy's Core Worlds region. Tepasi was the homeworld of Grand General Cassio Tagge, a member of the Galactic Empire during the Galactic Civil War who was born into the noble House of Tagge. It shared its name with Tepasi taffy. " ;
