<https://starwars.com#planet_Thule>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Thule was a location in the Esstran sector of the galaxy. Doctor Chelli Lona Aphra owned a certificate from the Imperial Institute for Archaeological Exploitation that gave her limited clearance to access Thule, a site of historical importance to the Galactic Empire, according to bylaws 22.750-23.018 of the Harvester Accords. The mercenary gang known as Thugs of Thule were headquartered there. " ;
