<https://starwars.com#planet_UldaFrav>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Ulda Frav was a tropical Expansion Region planet located in the Hangshan sector. Located in widely explored space by 5000 BBY, by 3998 BBY the world was visited by both a group of Jedi who arbitrated a treaty there and the Nazzar Crown Prince Qrrrl Toq. On the planet, the Jedi informed Toq of his potential for becoming a Jedi, which he eventually did. Millennia later, Vlaydm Churhee served as a sharpshooter on Ulda Frav before forming the Churhee's Riflemen mercenary unit. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#e6fb39de-36b1-43ad-a6c6-fca12cc501e4> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Hangshan> , <https://starwars.com#grid_P11> ;
