<https://starwars.com#planet_Vaced>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Vaced was a terrestrial astronomical object in the galaxy. At some point between 32 BBY and 22 BBY, Jedi Knight Obi-Wan Kenobi and his Padawan, Anakin Skywalker, visited Vaced. The two encountered a Moggonite bounty hunter there, and Skywalker saved Kenobi's life. Later, during a mission to the planet Cato Neimoidia after Skywalker had become a Knight himself, he brought up the incident on Vaced while telling Kenobi he intended to start tracking how many times he had saved the Jedi Master. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#f1f59ec9-6b5c-4cb5-b578-ddc253066246> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_J7> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Jalor> ;
