<https://starwars.com#planet_Vasha>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Vasha was an astronomical object located in the Moddell sector of the Outer Rim Territories in grid square H-16 of the Standard Galactic Grid. It was linked by the Houche Run hyperspace route to the celestial body Maya Kovel, while another route connected it to the astronomical object Vex. Vasha was depicted on a map of the Moddell sector included with the Rebel Alliance collection of non-electronic documents known as The Rebel Files. " ;
