<https://starwars.com#planet_Vaykaaris>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "The Vaykaaris system was located in the Southern Core portion of[2] the Colonies.[1] In approximately 41 BBY,[3] a terrorist group[4] based in the system[2] threatened more than a hundred worlds in the Colonies in what became known as the Vaykaaris Uprising. To resolve the dispute, twelve members of the Jedi Order were dispatched aboard the corvette Freedom's Messenger." ;
