<https://starwars.com#planet_XaFel>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Xa Fel was an astronomical object in the Core Worlds that housed a shipyard. During the Galactic Civil War, the shipyard of Xa Fel served the Galactic Empire. After the start of Operation Ringbreaker, General Crix Madine of the Rebellion designated it as a medium-priority target with low security level on a galactic map included in The Rebel Files, a top-secret dossier of sensitive information vital to the Rebellion. In 5 ABY, the New Republic fought to gain control of it. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#5fb83c97-6e65-437e-9bd7-9b8d28f1b976> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#region_Core> , <https://starwars.com#grid_K9> ;
