<https://starwars.com#planet_Yhifar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Yhifar was a Mid Rim gas giant located in the Juvex sector. It was the site of the Gas Vortex, the eye of an immense, millennia-old storm. The Gas Vortex provided living beings with tolerable atmospheric pressure and breathable air, allowing the construction of settlements in that area. Reckless gas miners dived into the high-pressure depths of Yhifar in armored submersibles tethered to mining platforms in the Gas Vortex. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#2d4b7dd1-4b68-4774-91b5-3aec5cd48394> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#grid_L17> , <https://starwars.com#sector_Juvex> ;
