<https://starwars.com#planet_Yout>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Yout was a planet with at least twelve moons, located in the Yout system. In 22 BBY, the assassin droid KRONOS-327, employee of crime lord Ziro the Hutt, returned to Ziro's Palace on the planet Coruscant after an unsuccessful mission to the twelfth moon of Yout. When KRONOS-327 reported the failure to Ziro, the Hutt sentenced the droid to be scrapped. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#dab6ff33-dd26-418c-aecb-6f83f3418488> ;
