<https://starwars.com#planet_Zanbar>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Zanbar was a temperate swamp moon in the Outer Rim Territories covered with massive rocky plateaus. During the Clone Wars, the Mandalorian splinter group Death Watch established a temporary camp on its surface, which continued to be used after Death Watch allied with Maul to form the Shadow Collective. Zanbar was later the site of a battle between the Shadow Collective and the Confederacy of Independent Systems. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#e5b2fbe9-f5d6-4821-b72e-3b87c7ed0735> ;
