<https://starwars.com#planet_Zyluria>
        rdf:type              ies:Planet ;
        rdfs:comment          "Zyluria was a world located in the Zyluria system of the Juvex sector, a part of the Senex-Juvex region in the Western Reaches portion of the Mid Rim. A hyperlane linked it to the Carsanza system. Zyluria's surface featured gentle plains, and it was the homeworld of the Zylurians, a sentient species that, by 43 ABY, had long served the aristocratic Ancient Houses of the Senex-Juvex. " ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#94465ab0-12ed-4272-b3b9-1ea1b4556ff1> ;
        ies:inLocation        <https://starwars.com#sector_Juvex> , <https://starwars.com#grid_L18> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Zyluria" .

