<https://starwars.com#person_GalenErso>
        rdf:type              ies:Person ;
        rdfs:comment          "Galen Walton Erso was a human male scientist and leading galactic authority on crystallography and energy enrichment. Born on the planet Grange, an agricultural backwater world, Erso was drafted into the Republic Futures Program, where his skill and intelligence ultimately led him to becoming a critical component, though reluctant, in the development of the DS-1 Death Star Mobile Battle Station. In doing so, Erso managed to subtly sabotage its design in a way that ultimately proved disastrous for the Galactic Empire." ;
        ies:hasName           <https://starwars.com#9f4136dd-0832-4888-82e1-0fc49be2291d> ;
        ies:parentOf          <https://starwars.com#person_JynErso> ;
        graphql:primaryName  "Galen Erso" .

